{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49838","headline":"菩萨蛮 七 · 冯延巳","name":"菩萨蛮 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈沈朱户横金锁，纱窗月影随花过。\n烛泪欲阑干，落梅生晚寒。\n宝钗横翠凤，千里香屏梦。\n云雨已荒凉，江南春草长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}